00:06:09,473 --> 00:06:15,473
Live or die on this day.

2
00:12:18,947 --> 00:12:24,947
The Grey is a action, adventure, drama film directed by Joe Carnahan.

3
00:18:28,421 --> 00:18:34,421
Following a grueling five-week shift at an Alaskan oil refinery, workers led by
sharpshooter John Ottway are flying home for a much-needed vacation.

4
00:24:37,894 --> 00:24:43,894
But a brutal storm causes their plane to crash in the frozen
wilderness, and only eight men, including Ottway, survive.

5
00:30:47,368 --> 00:30:53,368
As they trek southward toward civilization and safety, Ottway and his companions must
battle mortal injuries, the icy elements, and a pack of hungry wolves.

6
00:36:56,842 --> 00:37:02,842
John Ottway, played by Liam Neeson.

7
00:43:06,315 --> 00:43:12,315
Jerome Talget, played by Dermot Mulroney.

8
00:49:15,789 --> 00:49:21,789
John Diaz, played by Frank Grillo.

9
00:55:25,263 --> 00:55:31,263
Pete Henrick, played by Dallas Roberts.

10
01:01:34,736 --> 01:01:40,736
Jackson Burke, played by Nonso Anozie.

11
01:07:44,210 --> 01:07:50,210
Luke Lewenden, played by James Badge Dale.

12
01:13:53,684 --> 01:13:59,684
The Grey is a 2011 survival thriller film co-written, produced and directed by Joe Carnahan, and starring Liam
Neeson, Frank Grillo, Dermot Mulroney, Dallas Roberts, Joe Anderson, Nonso Anozie, and James Badge Dale.

13
01:20:03,157 --> 01:20:09,157
It is based on the short story "Ghost Walker" by Ian MacKenzie
Jeffers, who also co-wrote the screenplay with Carnahan.

14
01:26:12,631 --> 01:26:18,631
The story follows a number of oil-men stranded in Alaska after a plane crash who must survive a
pack of Canadian grey wolves, stalking them during the mercilessly cold weather.

15
01:32:22,105 --> 01:32:28,105
Released in the United States on January 27, 2012, the film received positive reviews,
with praise for its philosophical themes, and for Liam Neeson's performance.

16
01:38:31,578 --> 01:38:37,578
It grossed $81 million worldwide.

17
01:44:41,052 --> 01:44:47,052
The film explores themes of wolf, flashback, alaska,
airplane crash, struggle for survival.

18
01:50:50,526 --> 01:50:56,526
The tone is intense and dark and emotional.
